{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Aetheria</strong>, a vibrant fantasy world where villagers complain about sheep, wizards throw tantrums, and some grandmas will really beat you with sticks if you mess with their knitting circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t another &quot;silent hero saves the kingdom&quot; story. You are Fayme, a loudmouth whose tongue is deadlier than any blade. Win battles with swords, spells, and sharp insults. Trash-talk a wizard mid-fireball and walk away victorious - or make them so mad they turn you into ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So... fight with fists, fight with fire, or fight with words. Either way, someone\u2019s leaving embarrassed. Hopefully not you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Banter:</strong> Use your wit to provoke, confuse, scare, or even calm down your enemies. Every insult is a gamble, but the payoff can be huge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Combat:</strong> Punches, kicks, weapons, spells, dodges, parries, and ridiculous finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies With Feelings:</strong> Rage, fear, pride, vanity - exploit their mood swings to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Magic:</strong> Master powerful spells of fire, air, water, and earth. They look spectacular (and occasionally backfire).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Fantasy World:</strong> Explore a quirky land full of eccentric characters and sarcastic quests. Speak or fight - the choice is yours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597640?t=1772127929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597640/d1fc77e06f6f2160b0a29bc15cd50266e2fca728/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772127929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste